OL,3,GNEWSAShould we build 15 new homes in
OL,4,Aevery village?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe need for affordable housing in
OL,7,Frural areas is something every party
OL,8,Fagrees on.
OL,10,FSchools, pubs and shops are closing in
OL,11,Fvillages and younger people are being
OL,12,Fforced to move out because they cannot
OL,13,Fbuy a home in the place they grew up.
OL,15,FA study from English Rural, a
OL,16,Fnot-for-profit housing association with
OL,17,Fhomes in 140 villages, including in
OL,18,FOxfordshire, Berkshire and Hampshire,
OL,19,Ffound the average rural house price was
OL,20,Fabout 16 times average rural earnings.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
