OL,3,GNEWSAShould we build 15 new homes in
OL,4,Aevery village?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne idea discussed at a fringe meeting
OL,7,Fat the Conservative conference in
OL,8,FBirmingham was for every village to
OL,9,Fbuild at least 10 to 15 new homes.
